  <item>
    <title><![CDATA[Home]]></title>
    <link>http://localhost/staging/kebumen/?p=10</link>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 09:14:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator><![CDATA[kebumen_admin]]></dc:creator>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">http://localhost/staging/kebumen/?p=10</guid>
    <description></description>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>Cerdas Dalam Berpikir<br>Jujur Dalam Bertindak</h1>		<p>Melepas Langkah, Mengukir Masa Depan, Meraih Impian</p>								<a href="/pendaftaran">n									Pendaftarann					</a>n						https://youtube.com/shorts/iGVGH0GwB2M?si=2GXClwpCKYMSXAY2			<h6>Welcome</h6>					<h2>Selamat Datang di SMK 10 November Kebumen Jawa Tengah</h2>		<p>Selamat datang di halaman website SMK 10 November Kebumen Jawa Tengah</p>								<a href="/pendaftaran">n									Pendaftarann					</a>n														<a href="/sejarah">n									Profil Sekolahn					</a>n							Visi						n									<p>n						Mewujudkan lulusan yang berkarakter, berbudaya,kompeten dan siap melanjutkan pendidikann<br><br>nIndikator Visi:<br>n1. Terwujudnya siswa tidak hanya unggul secara akademik, tetapi juga memiliki nilai-nilai moral, etika, sosial, dan spiritual yang kuat.<br>n2. Terwujudnya siswa mengenal, menghargai, dan mempraktikkan budaya lokal seperti tarian, bahasa daerah, makanan tradisional, dan upacara adat.<br>n3. Menunjukkan kemandirian dalam belajar dan perencanaan masa depan baik berkerja maupun melanjutkan Pendidikan.n					</p>n							Misi						n									<p>n						1.	Menanamkan nilai-nilai moral dan spiritual dalam pembelajaran serta kehidupan sehari-hari di sekolah untuk membentuk lulusan yang berkarakter.<br>n2.	Membiasakan perilaku santun, toleran, bertanggung jawab, dan peduli terhadap sesama sebagai wujud budaya sekolah yang positif.<br>n3.	Mengembangkan pembelajaran aktif, kreatif, dan bermakna untuk meningkatkan kompetensi akademik dan keterampilan siswa.<br>n4.	Meningkatkan penguasaan literasi, numerasi, dan keterampilan berpikir kritis sebagai bekal melanjutkan pendidikan ke jenjang yang lebih tinggi<br>n5.	Menyelenggarakan kegiatan ekstrakurikuler dan projek berbasis budaya lokal dan nasional untuk memperkuat identitas kebangsaan siswa.<br>n6.	Menciptakan iklim sekolah yang aman, nyaman, dan kondusif bagi tumbuh kembang pribadi dan potensi peserta didik.<br>n7.	Membangun kemitraan dengan orang tua dan masyarakat dalam mendukung proses pendidikan yang berkelanjutan					</p>n								<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/brosur_kebumen_001.webp" alt="brosur_kebumen_001" /></figure><figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/brosur_kebumen_002.webp" alt="brosur_kebumen_002" /></figure>			n						<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z"></path></svg>					n						<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z"></path></svg>					n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-1.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="4d7730e" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktMS5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0ZDc3MzBlIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-2.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="4d7730e" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3MywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktMi5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0ZDc3MzBlIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-3.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="4d7730e" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktMy5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0ZDc3MzBlIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-4.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="4d7730e" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktNC5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0ZDc3MzBlIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-5.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="4d7730e" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktNS5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0ZDc3MzBlIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-6.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="4d7730e" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI4MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktNi5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0ZDc3MzBlIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-1.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="1210d23" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktMS5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIxMjEwZDIzIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-2.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="1210d23" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3MywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktMi5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIxMjEwZDIzIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-3.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="1210d23" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktMy5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIxMjEwZDIzIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-4.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="1210d23" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktNC5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIxMjEwZDIzIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-5.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="1210d23" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktNS5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIxMjEwZDIzIn0%3D">n														</a>n							<a href="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/gallery-6.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="1210d23" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI4MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3NtazEwbm92ZW1iZXJrZWJ1bWVuLnNjaC5pZFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcL2dhbGxlcnktNi5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIxMjEwZDIzIn0%3D">n														</a>n						<h2>Tersedia Beasiswa Bagi Peserta Didik Berprestasi</h2>					Arcu nullam sollicitudin condimentum justo libero fringilla tellus augue tempus. Velit habitasse commodo habitant laoreet condimentum nisl maximus tellus ex. Luctus viverra montes si hac ligula maximus vitae proin placerat finibus volutpat.										<a href="/pendaftaran">n									Pendaftarann					</a>n														<a href="/pendaftaran">n									Info Lebih Lanjutn					</a>n																			<img width="770" height="1024" src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-10-at-08.55.46-770x1024.jpeg" alt="" srcset="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-10-at-08.55.46-770x1024.jpeg 770w, https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-10-at-08.55.46-226x300.jpeg 226w, https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-10-at-08.55.46-768x1021.jpeg 768w, https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-10-at-08.55.46.jpeg 963w" sizes="(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px" />																<h2>Kenggulan SMK 10 November Tambun Selatan</h2>							n							Academic Excellence						n									<p>n						Pellentesque felis eros fames id torquent molestie himenaeos.					</p>n							Cutting-Edge Facilities						n									<p>n						Pellentesque felis eros fames id torquent molestie himenaeos.					</p>n							Diverse Learning Community						n									<p>n						Pellentesque felis eros fames id torquent molestie himenaeos.					</p>n							Career Development Support						n									<p>n						Pellentesque felis eros fames id torquent molestie himenaeos.					</p>n							Commitment to Sustainability						n									<p>n						Pellentesque felis eros fames id torquent molestie himenaeos.					</p>n							Student Support Services						n									<p>n						Pellentesque felis eros fames id torquent molestie himenaeos.					</p>n							<h3>Prestasi Terbaik</h3>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/gallery-3-rhknzfj64zwdme3yzfojo56c62yflj0ttkxz6nyjds.jpg" title="gallery (3)" alt="gallery (3)" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/gallery-2-rhknzelby5v3as5c4x9x3nevkp32dtx3hgahnazbc0.jpg" title="gallery (2)" alt="gallery (2)" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/img_kebumen_006-rhkoabhvawsy3samen3z1w9jvrahrb8wbgzg14l79c.webp" title="img_kebumen_006" alt="img_kebumen_006" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/img_kebumen_005-rhko9nzwk1ws1j8r7uyatk7114ibevnlw8ob17k1kw.webp" title="img_kebumen_005" alt="img_kebumen_005" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<h3>Prestasi Terbaik</h3>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/gallery-3-rhknzfj64zwdme3yzfojo56c62yflj0ttkxz6nyjds.jpg" title="gallery (3)" alt="gallery (3)" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/gallery-2-rhknzelby5v3as5c4x9x3nevkp32dtx3hgahnazbc0.jpg" title="gallery (2)" alt="gallery (2)" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/img_kebumen_006-rhkoabhvawsy3samen3z1w9jvrahrb8wbgzg14l79c.webp" title="img_kebumen_006" alt="img_kebumen_006" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<figure><img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/img_kebumen_005-rhko9nzwk1ws1j8r7uyatk7114ibevnlw8ob17k1kw.webp" title="img_kebumen_005" alt="img_kebumen_005" loading="lazy" /></figure>					<h6>Fasilitas</h6>					<h2>Terlengkap &amp; Modern</h2>										<a href="/fasilitas">n									Lihat Semuan					</a>n																<figure>n										<img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/img_kebumen_007-rhkoq2ajs0cuknfbgy40bf8i33otosr1hed8ez8t1c.webp" title="img_kebumen_007" alt="img_kebumen_007" loading="lazy" />											<figcaption>Ruang Guru</figcaption>n										</figure>n																	<figure>n										<img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/gallery-6-rhko1r6t192wboqgexucc22d1di3ml8xt306waii00.jpg" title="gallery (6)" alt="gallery (6)" loading="lazy" />											<figcaption>Ruang Kelas</figcaption>n										</figure>n																	<figure>n										<img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/img_kebumen_001-rhko9oxqqvy2d57e2dcxe1yhmidomkrc8dbsihineo.webp" title="img_kebumen_001" alt="img_kebumen_001" loading="lazy" />											<figcaption>Lab Komputer</figcaption>n										</figure>n																	<figure>n										<img src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/img_kebumen_009-rhkoqk5hdv1ap8pdkntx4sq9df8sr1pxvurgj8ibr4.webp" title="img_kebumen_009" alt="img_kebumen_009" loading="lazy" />											<figcaption>Perpustakaan</figcaption>n										</figure>n										<h3>Ekstrakurikuler</h3>					<figure><img width="600" height="400" src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_kebumen_003.webp" alt="" /></figure>Pencak Silat					<figure><img width="600" height="400" src="https://smk10novemberkebumen.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_kebumen_002.webp" alt="" /></figure>Ta